# Compositor (meson). `.vm` is the QEMU disk from scripts/vm-init
# and `.cache` is meson's; both are regenerable and neither belongs in git.
compositor/build/
compositor/.vm/
compositor/.cache/
/.vm/
# Meson build
build
build-release

# Cloned by scripts/fetch-nprpc.sh / scripts/build-wlroots.sh, not vendored.
/third-party/nprpc
/third-party/wlroots

# npidl's output from idl/lava.npidl, both languages. Generated rather than
# vendored: npidl comes out of the same nprpc build the control plane links
# against, so anything that can build this can regenerate these — and a stub
# committed against one revision of the IDL and read against another is a
# desync that compiles. `scripts/bootstrap.sh` runs the generator; by hand it
# is `scripts/gen_stubs.sh`.
/Sources/LavaIDL/
/compositor/src/gen/
